WEBVTT

00:11:59.649 --> 00:12:01.757
Or is it observer-relative?

00:12:01.781 --> 00:12:05.284
Well, some computations are intrinsic.

00:12:05.308 --> 00:12:07.195
I add two plus two to get four.

00:12:07.219 --> 00:12:09.766
That's going on no matter
what anybody thinks.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.255
But when I haul out my pocket calculator

00:12:12.279 --> 00:12:16.037
and do the calculation,
the only intrinsic phenomenon

00:12:16.061 --> 00:12:19.212
is the electronic circuit
and its behavior.

00:12:19.236 --> 00:12:20.976
That's the only absolute phenomenon.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.404
All the rest is interpreted by us.

00:12:23.428 --> 00:12:27.245
Computation only exists
relative to consciousness.

00:12:27.269 --> 00:12:30.020
Either a conscious agent
is carrying out the computation,